# Verification & completion report

No substantial task is complete because code was written. Verify the actual result.

## Verification levels (do not confuse)

1. Source · 2. Static · 3. Unit · 4. Types/lint · 5. Integration · 6. Contract · 7. Build (`pio run`) · 8. Soft-AP/API smoke · 9. Hosted/cloud pairing · 10. Physical hardware

Firmware compile ≠ RS485 works. Simulation ≠ field bus validation.

## After changes

- Build the relevant PlatformIO env. State NOT RUN/why if hardware checks skipped.
- Never invent monitor logs, COM ports, or pass counts.

## Substantial tasks require this exact report

Firmware/Modbus/net/uplink/CLI/config/build/docs-status work. Skip only for trivial Q&A.

### 1. TASK SUMMARY
- Task / Objective / Final status: COMPLETE | PARTIALLY COMPLETE | BLOCKED / Outcome

### 2. FILES CHANGED
Created/modified/deleted with brief why (or none).

### 3. IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS
What, how, modules affected, design decisions, compatibility.

### 4. VERIFICATION AND TEST RESULTS
Table: Check | Command | Result PASS/FAIL/NOT RUN | Evidence

### 5. ACTUAL BEHAVIOR VERIFICATION
Compile / simulation / logs / physical test / HW+FW revision — or NOT VERIFIED.

### 6. SECURITY AND DATA-INTEGRITY CHECK
Credentials, uplink secrecy, config persistence, any destructive flash/erase.

### 7. DEPLOYMENT AND ENVIRONMENT STATUS
Env/board flashed or NOT DEPLOYED; FW version; rollback notes.

### 8. KNOWN ISSUES AND LIMITATIONS
Unresolved, deferred, missing evidence, hardware limits.

### 9. DOCUMENTATION UPDATED
`doc/` files touched / none.

### 10. FINAL ENGINEERING VERDICT
COMPLETE — VERIFIED | COMPLETE WITH DOCUMENTED LIMITATIONS | PARTIALLY COMPLETE | BLOCKED | FAILED

### 11. NEXT ACTIONS
Safe now · needs owner approval · needs production auth · needs hardware auth
